+
+**I. THE SHAPE OF THE PROOF, IN ONE SENTENCE.** Four-dimensional Yang–Mills is asymptotic freedom in the ultraviolet glued to strong coupling in the infrared: the renormalization group carries the lattice theory at spacing a and coupling β(a) → ∞ from the scale a, where the coupling is small and the theory perturbative, down to the scale ξ(a) ≈ a·e^{β/(2N b₀)} where the effective coupling is of order one; below ξ the theory is in the regime where this tree's strong-coupling machinery is a theorem — Dobrushin's uniform gap (Β3), the 't Hooft sectors and their MacWilliams duality (Α2, FluxCore, ΑΝΕΞΑΛΕΙΠΤΟΝ), the Perron-root string energies (Α4c) — and the physical gap is Δ ≈ 1/ξ, finite and positive as a → 0. EVERY PIECE OF THIS SENTENCE BUT ONE is landed, drafted, or classical and formalizable; the one is THE CROSSOVER THEOREM: that the flow from the ultraviolet enters the infrared regime with its remainders controlled over the log(1/a) steps between. That theorem is the open core of C22 — and it is a theorem with a statement, an instrument and a falsifier, not a wall.
+
+**II. THE CROSSOVER THEOREM, EXACTLY.** Let c^{(0)} be the character coefficients of the plaquette action at scale a (for the Wilson or heat-kernel action an explicit vector in ΚΥΚΛΟΤΟΜΙΑ's ring), let c^{(n)} be the effective action after n block-spin steps of size b, and let α(c) be the Dobrushin coefficient of the x-transfer slab with plaquette action c (Β3's α: a function of the action's ratio bounds and the plaquette degree; the concurrent seat's per-site lemma for Z₂, its Q₈ analogue, the ratio lemma for any group). THE CROSSOVER THEOREM: there is n*(β) with b^{n*} ≈ ξ(β)/a such that α(c^{(n*)}) < 1, and the effective theory at scale n* differs from a theory in a finite-parameter family of positive class-function actions by a remainder whose Dobrushin coefficient is summable along the flow — so that Β3's uniform gap at scale n* reads back to scale 0 as Δ_lat(β) ≥ b^{−n*}(−log α) and in physical units Δ ≥ (1/ξ)(−log α) > 0. Its two halves: (A) THE FLOW'S ARITHMETIC — the perturbative part is ΑΝΑΒΑΘΡΑ's exact two-loop map (T-531: a rational map of ℚ³ with the one-loop meeting rational; T-533: every p-adic valuation, once nonzero, never moves), which fixes n*(β) exactly — the crossover scale is where that map's coupling reaches the Dobrushin threshold; (B) THE REMAINDER CONTROL — Balaban's small-field/large-field analysis (1984–89, ultraviolet stability proved for the partition function; the carrying of the effective action to the infrared scale and the correlations' convergence not done by him or anyone): the part no one has, named as such.
+
+**III. WHAT III OWNS THAT BEARS ON EACH PIECE.** (1) THE INFRARED REGIME IS A THEOREM: Β3 (Dobrushin, drafted in five files) gives the gap uniform in the cross-section for any action with α < 1; Β6 carries it to SU(N). (2) THE ORDER PARAMETER IS THE 't HOOFT VORTEX FREE ENERGY, AND IT IS A PERRON-ROOT DIFFERENCE: the twisted partition functions Z_m are traces of sector transfer matrices (ΣΤΡΟΦΙΓΞ, ΤΟΜΕΥΣ read their spectra exactly), their free energies per unit time are log λ₀(M₀) − log λ₀(M_m) (StringEnergy.lean, landed), the electric sectors are their Z_N Fourier transform (MacWilliams, landed as Α2, 't Hooft 1979), and Tomboulis–Yaffe (1985) bound the Wilson loop by the vortex free energy through reflection positivity — so CONFINEMENT IS A STATEMENT ABOUT PERRON ROOTS OF FINITE MATRICES, the objects this tree reads exactly. (3) THE FLOW IS AN EXACT DYNAMICAL SYSTEM OVER ℚ IN THE CHARACTER BASIS: a decimation step is a convolution (a monomial map on the coefficients, c_λ ↦ c_λ^{b²}/d_λ^{b²−1}) followed by a bond-moving (an integer-coefficient polynomial map by Clebsch–Gordan, exact in ΚΥΚΛΟΤΟΜΙΑ's ring, ΠΙΝΑΞ/ΣΤΡΟΒΙΛΟΣ's characters for finite groups), the twist a sign on the half-integer characters — ANABATHRA's kind of object; Kadanoff's variational argument makes one such flow a rigorous bound on the free energy, and Tomboulis (2007) claimed upper and lower decimation flows sandwiching the vortex free energy at every coupling, the interpolation between them being the step not accepted. With exact arithmetic the two flows' twisted ratios are READ at every scale: parting, that road is dead by a number; together into the strong-coupling regime, the sandwich is the theorem to write, finite algebra per step. (4) THE APPROACH TO THE FIXED POINT IS A RESIDUAL IDENTITY (ΤΕΛΕΥΤΗ T-135, ΑΛΜΑ T-140): a polynomial flow's distance from its limit at every step is exact, no asymptotics taken. (5) THE QUANTITY IS NAMED (ΚΑΤΑΤΜΗΣΙΣ T-271): the physical gap a⁻¹Δ_lat(β(a)) along the sequence, not "the continuum limit"; ΓΕΦΥΡΩΣΙΣ Theorem F says why the lattice gap never closes on a finite carrier — the closing lives in the completion. (6) THE PERISCOPE LAW IS THE CROSSOVER (T-661): the ultraviolet layer's blind axis — perturbation theory sees no gap, no area law, a twist at O(1) action — is the aperture onto the infrared layer, where the twist costs nothing and the flux costs an area. (7) THE INTEGRALITY (ΚΑΜΨΙΣ T-475; ΑΡΤΙΟΤΗΣ): the partition function in the character basis is an integer series whose coefficients count invariants; the flow preserves the ring; the continuum is its archimedean boundary.
